WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.980
In Lessons, choose Add lessons to calendar.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.584
Check the class, then choose Get subscription link.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.667
Open your calendar app from these buttons, then confirm the subscription there.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:18.432
Or copy the link and use your calendar’s subscription option. Add Google subscriptions from a computer.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.638
For birthdays, open Care, choose Birthdays, then Add birthdays to calendar.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.596
Get the birthday link and subscribe the same way. These are two separate calendars.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:37.034
Keep these personal links private. Changes appear when your calendar app refreshes, so use a subscription rather than importing a file.
